    Setting ``axes=0`` for one-dimensional inputs is equivalent to
    :func:`~jax.numpy.outer`:

    >>> x1 = jnp.array([1, 2])
    >>> x2 = jnp.array([1, 2, 3])
    >>> jnp.linalg.tensordot(x1, x2, axes=0)
    Array([[1, 2, 3],
