  See also:
    - :func:`jax.numpy.einsum`: NumPy API for more general tensor contractions.
    - :func:`jax.lax.dot_general`: XLA API for more general tensor contractions.

  Examples:
    >>> x1 = jnp.arange(24.).reshape(2, 3, 4)
    >>> x2 = jnp.ones((3, 4, 5))
